# This is the Final Project for Web Technologies 

### The website will contain 6 pages as requested for the assessment:
- Landing page (index.html) with some general info about me and my projects
- Contact page will have a contact form
- About page will have a brief description of myself, my studies and hobbies
- Project page where will be possible to see the projects done throught the year
- Mywork will redirect to my previous assessment in Web Technologies
- Resume will contain my work experiences, education and skills

### Tools and Technologies that are going to be used are:
- TailwindCSS for styling the webpage and make them responsive
- Javascript for animation and functionalities
- API for contact form
